{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 VelvetClip\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Transparent threshold-linear soft clipper and peak dynamics controller with 100% bit-identical pass-through below threshold, 808 Sub Safe preservation, and delta-filtered 2x oversampling.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 100% Bit-Identical Pass-Through (y = x) for all audio below threshold (0% harmonic coloration until clipping)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Interactive Transfer Graph: Drag vertically directly on the response curve to offset clipping threshold\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 3 Specialized Clipper Topologies:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Classic Exponential (Mode 0): Exact exponential knee y = T + W(1 - exp(-d/W)) with C1 continuity\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Cubic Knee (Mode 1): Smooth punchy polynomial knee that clamps strictly at 0 dBFS ceiling\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Velvet Rational (Mode 2): Slower asymptotic curve y = T + W(d / (W + d)) for warm saturation\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 808 Sub Safe: 95 Hz SVF shelf pre-attenuates & post-restores sub-bass to prevent buzz\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Delta-Filtered 2x OS: Antialiases only the shaved distortion delta (0% dry phase smear)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Dual Waveform & Shaved-Peak History Scope: Live scrolling view showing output waveform and shaved peak transients in real-time\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Calibrated Peak & Clip Metering: Precision output level bar and shaved dB clip amount indicator\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scalable HiDPI UI: Vector interface with selectable text scaling presets (100% - 150%)\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 ConsoleQ\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Hybrid Console Channel Strip Equalizer with E/G series curves, high-headroom Air Band, Sub weight, and real-time FFT spectrum analyzer.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 4-Band Console EQ (LF, LMF, HMF, HF) with switchable Bell/Shelf modes on LF and HF\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 18 dB/oct HPF (20 - 500 Hz) and 12 dB/oct LPF (3k - 22 kHz) console filters\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab High-headroom Air Band with selectable frequencies (2.5k, 5k, 10k, 20k, 40 kHz) and Sub 10Hz resonance control\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Switchable E-Series (Constant Q) and G-Series (Proportional Q) EQ topologies\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Analog character modes: Clean, Subtle, and Warm saturation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Interactive draggable EQ nodes directly on the curve display\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Real-time 2048-point FFT Spectrum Analyzer (Post-EQ, Pre-EQ, or Off)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Momentary band solo auditioning per frequency band\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Output stage with M/S stereo width (0-200%), panning, auto-gain, and latched peak LED\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scalable HiDPI text zoom (100% - 140%)\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
