{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 ReEQ Studio\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Polished 16-Band Parametric Equalizer with advanced spectrum analyzer, Mid/Side routing, Butterworth/Analog cut models, and musical Pultec curves.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 16 fully parametric filter bands with individual solo, gain, Q, frequency, and slope controls\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Multiple filter topologies: Peak, Low/High Cut (including Butterworth and Analog models), Low/High Shelf, Notch, Band Pass, Tilt Shelf, Pultec Low Shelf, and All Pass\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Flexible stereo routing: Stereo, Mid/Side, Left/Right processing per band\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab High-resolution real-time FFT spectrum analyzer with Pre-EQ, Post-EQ, Mid/Side, and L/R visualization\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Smart context-aware band creation and interactive multi-node marquee selection\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab High-Quality (HQ) oversampling mode with FIR half-band filtering\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Piano roll scale display and musical note snapping\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Credits\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Original ReEQ DSP & core architecture by Justin Johnson (ReJJ).\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 AetherVerb\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 8-Mode Algorithmic, Shimmer & FDN Reverb workstation with auto-decay ducking, analog preamps, era conversion, hold/freeze, and post parametric EQ.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 8 Distinct Reverb Algorithms: Plate 140, Concert Hall, Cloud, Shimmer, Bloom, Chorale, Non-Linear, and SuperFDN (8-delay Feedback Delay Network)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Shimmer Engine: Multi-voice pitch shifting with selectable intervals (-1 Oct, -5th, Detune, +5th, +1 Oct, +2 Oct)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Chorale Resonators: Formant vowel filtering (AH, OH, OO, Morph) for ethereal vocal-like resonance\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Auto-Decay (SuperPlate Style): Dynamic envelope follower that ducks reverb decay or wet level during active playing to prevent mix clutter\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Preamps & Converter Eras: Clean, Tube V54, Solid State 162 preamps with Modern HiFi, 70s 12-Bit, and 80s Dark converter modeling\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Infinite & Freeze: Instant hold modes for endless ambient sustain drones\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Tone & Equalization: Pre Low/High Cut filters plus a 2-band parametric post-EQ\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scalable HiDPI Interface: Vector UI with text zoom (100% - 150%) and collapsible tweak drawer\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
