{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 AetherSynth\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 8-Voice polyphonic unison and Zero-Delay Feedback (ZDF) analog synthesizer with multi-wave supersaw, FM/Sync oscillator, vintage ladder filters, dual envelopes, and onboard master effects.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 8-Voice Polyphony: Polyphonic, Mono, and Legato voice allocation with portamento glide and organic analog drift/slop\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Dual Oscillators & Sub/Noise:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Oscillator 1: Stepped octaves (-2 to +2), 1-7 Unison voices with variable detune and stereo spread\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Oscillator 2: Hard sync, linear FM, ring modulation, pulse width modulation (PWM), and fine tuning\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Dedicated sub-oscillator (-1 / -2 octaves) and analog white noise generator\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab 3 Zero-Delay Feedback (ZDF) Filter Topologies:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Ladder 24dB: Classic fat Moog-style transistor ladder with non-linear saturation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Bite Screamer: Aggressive MS-20 style resonant filter with screaming feedback\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Uhbie Morph: Continuous multi-mode 12dB filter morphing between Low-Pass, Band-Pass, and High-Pass\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Interactive Filter Display: Real-time frequency response visualization\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Dual Modulation Envelopes:\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li720 \fi-360 \endash \tx360\tab Amp ADSR and Mod ADSR with live visual envelope trace\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Dual LFOs: Sine, Triangle, Saw, Square, and Random S&H targeting pitch vibrato, PWM, and filter cutoff\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Master FX Engine: Analog distortion, stereo chorus, tempo/free ping-pong delay, and algorithmic hall reverb\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Built-In Factory Soundbank: 8 production-ready patches (Anthem Supersaw, Diva Ladder Bass, Acid 303, Jupiter Pad, etc.)\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Interactive 4-Octave Keyboard: Playable onscreen piano keys with active voice indicator\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab Scalable HiDPI UI: Clean vector layout with selectable UI zoom (100% - 150%)\sa180\par}
}

